{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"First mandatory plan review BLOCKED on two E4 compatibility omissions: moving the five functions would otherwise bypass tests that patch authorship.subprocess, and the internal verify_authorship_at_commit resolver path was not explicitly tied to the authorship module-global binding. Revised the plan to preserve both seams, expanded the name-string caller/monkeypatch census, pinned the exact Any-count oracle inherited from abasic-doddering-harrier, split compound ACs into executable checks, and added the new sibling module to file impact. Re-review is required before claim."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786843033556957001,"uuid":"ec6b80ab-8665-46fb-b4d0-6bda512ae882"}